    "title": "Wreaths Across America ceremony to be held at Mo. National Veterans Memorial set - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Amber Ruch ,\n11 hours ago PERRYVILLE, Mo. (KFVS) - A National Wreaths Across America ceremony will be held at Missouri’s National Veterans Memorial. According to a news release from MNVM, the wreath-laying ceremony will be at 11 a.m. on Saturday, December 13. They’ll be joining more than 3,700 other locations across the country for... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
